# Copy to .env, which is gitignored, and fill in. Read only by the live suite
# (`go test -tags=live`); the shipped binary never looks at it. An environment
# variable of the same name wins over the file.

# The project the live suite runs against. It WRITES there: each test creates
# and removes .dsx-selftest* paths, and there is no delete_project tool to undo
# a mistake, so name a project you own. `dsx project ls` lists them.
#
# Which one you pick decides coverage. A project you created carries a standing
# write grant, so TestLiveNeedsProjectGrantIsAnHTTP403NotAToolError skips
# against it and says so; covering that path needs a project shared with you but
# not created by you.
#
# Unset, every test that needs a project skips.
DSX_LIVE_PROJECT=
